<section class="sec sec--flush-top"><div class="wrap mf-details"><div><h2 class="display-m">Clear from<br><span class="serif">the start.</span></h2><p>This page is for motor dealers exploring broker support, rather than a customer credit application.</p></div><div><details open><summary>Is finance included in the FCA authorisation offer?</summary><p>No. Motor-finance arrangements are separate from the FCA authorisation assistance subscription. We’ll discuss the proposed arrangement and terms with you.</p></details><details><summary>Can we talk before our authorisation is granted?</summary><p>Yes, you can discuss future plans. Any regulated activity must wait until the necessary permissions and arrangements are in place. Authorisation does not automatically complete broker onboarding.</p></details><details><summary>Are customers guaranteed finance?</summary><p>No. Availability depends on customer circumstances, lender criteria and assessment. A conversation or application does not guarantee an offer of finance.</p></details></div></div></section>
